{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-01-19 08:05:00', 'title': 'TRACYLOCKE AND THE LEGO GROUP LAUNCH THE "STORE OF THE FUTURE"', 'text': 'DALLAS, JAN. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRACYLOCKE, LEADING COMMERCE\xa0AND COMMUNICATIONS\xa0AGENCY, IS PARTNERING WITH THE LEGO GROUP TO ACTIVATE THE LAUNCH OF ITS "STORE OF THE FUTURE" – A GLOBAL RETAIL CONCEPT ROOTED IN A SHOPPER JOURNEY OF CREATIVITY AND IMAGINATION. WITH EXPERTISE IN COMPELLING COMMERCE THROUGH CREATIVITY AND BRAND EXPERIENCE, TRACYLOCKE APPROACHED THE GLOBAL CAMPAIGN WITH A HYPER-LOCAL STRATEGY, CREATING CAMPAIGNS THAT APPEAL BROADLY TO TOURISTS WHILE SPEAKING ENDEARINGLY TO LOCALS IN BOTH NEW YORK CITY AND BARCELONA.'}